# Files of the full distro which do not resolve, and why that is accepted.
#
# Anything unresolved which is not listed here fails 'make check'.

# Nothing, currently.
#
# The two entries which used to be here were firefox's own libraries in
# /usr/lib/firefox, which it loads itself and which ldd cannot resolve from
# outside. Firefox is not in this distro any more. wpewebkit does not need the
# same allowance: it installs libWPEWebKit-2.0.so on the loader's search path
# and everything resolves normally.
